**[Suggestion]** `TEST_PATTERN` has four alternations but only `.test.` and `__tests__` are tested — `.spec.` and `.test-utils.` have no coverage — Concrete cost: a refactor dropping `.spec.` would misclassify `grep.spec.ts` as a production file, inflating `coreProd.length` and potentially assigning an extra reviewer.

```suggestion
const TEST_PATTERN = /\.test\.|\.spec\.|__tests__|\.test-utils\./;
// Add tests: classify(['packages/core/src/tools/grep.spec.ts'], ...) → 0 reviewers
// Add tests: classify(['packages/core/src/tools/test-utils.ts'], ...) → 0 reviewers
```

_— qwen3.7-max via Qwen Code /review_
